<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Granite 6-mth net up 835 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Granite 6-mth net up 835 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     9.65	    vs   loss  1.31</p>
<p>    Shr (cents) profit   4.3	     vs   loss  1.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		 82.61	   vs	   1.39</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 16.11	   vs   loss  1.31</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Granite Industries Bhd. It is involved in the timber industry as well as property development.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
